OL,3,ACovid inquiry rejects ministers' claims
OL,4,Aof 'protective ring' around care homes
OL,5,Aat start of pandemic
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere were more than 43,000 deaths
OL,8,Finvolving Covid in care homes between
OL,9,FMarch 2020 and July 2022
OL,11,FThe report outline multiple failings,
OL,12,Fincluding shortage of PPE, the way
OL,13,Fhospital patients were discharged into
OL,14,Fcare homes, and a lack of financial
OL,15,Fsupport for care workers
OL,17,FThe sixth module in the inquiry heard
OL,18,Ftestimonies from ministers, civil
OL,19,Fservants and families - one woman
OL,20,Fdescribed noticing that her mother was
OL,21,Fdying from Covid on a video call before
OL,22,Fstaff had realised
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
